  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen ever you get an Invite or an Invite Request you normally have a timer which tells you how long ago the Invite / Invite Request was.\n\nThis timer is currently broken and always stuck at \"A few seconds ago\", this is the case for both the Main and Quick Menu. \n\nFriend Requests and Group Notifications still work normally.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:\n\nThe timer show how long ago you've gotten a Invite / Invite Request, just like it used to.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a picture showcasing the issue:\n\nThat invite has been sitting there for a few minutes.",
